column1:
3:5|The LORD within her is righteous;
he does no injustice.
Morning after morning he brings his judgment to light;
he never fails.
But the unjust know no shame.|Retains repeated morning and the contrast between divine justice and shameless wrongdoers.

3:17|The LORD your God is among you,
a warrior who saves.
He will rejoice over you with delight;
he will be silent in his love;
he will celebrate over you with singing.”|Follows the pinned be-silent reading instead of silently substituting renew, and retains the warrior image.
